---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Yinpin | san serif" description="Master Pinyin and you can type any Chinese character you know, no handwriting required. Yinpin drills tone-accurate recall against the full HSK vocabulary, one word at a time.">
	<main class="wrapper">

		<section class="app-hero">

			<div class="video-container">
				<div class="video-glow"></div>
				<div class="media-placeholder hero-placeholder">Hero video — pending</div>
			</div>

			<div class="app-intro">
				<h1>Yinpin</h1>
				<p class="description">
					Every Chinese character you'll ever type starts with Pinyin. Get the sounds and tones right, and your phone does the rest, no handwriting required. Yinpin drills tone-accurate recall against the full HSK vocabulary, one word at a time, until production is second nature.
				</p>

				<a href="#" class="app-store-link">
					<img src="/images/app-store-badge.svg" alt="Download on the App Store" class="badge-svg" />
				</a>
			</div>

		</section>

		<div class="divider"></div>

		<section class="details-grid">

			<div class="detail-card">
				<div class="floating-container">
					<div class="media-placeholder">Screenshot — pending</div>
				</div>
			    <h3>Type to Recall</h3>
			    <p>Every card shows the word and its meaning, then asks you to type the romanization from memory, exactly like you would to produce that character on your phone. Checking your answer reveals the correct pinyin, tone marks included, right alongside the example sentence.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="detail-card">
				<div class="floating-container">
					<div class="media-placeholder">Screenshot — pending</div>
				</div>
				<h3>Adaptive Spaced Repetition</h3>
				<p>Scheduling adapts to how well you actually know each word, resurfacing the ones you're shakiest on more often than the ones you've already nailed.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="detail-card">
				<div class="floating-container">
					<div class="media-placeholder">Screenshot — pending</div>
				</div>
				<h3>Sentences, Not Just Words</h3>
				<p>Every card pairs its word with a full example sentence and a breakdown, so pronunciation is trained in context, not isolation.</p>
			</div>

		</section>

	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.wrapper {
		max-width: 1100px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 20px;
	}

	h1, p {
		margin-block: 0;
	}

	.app-hero {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
		padding-top: 30px;
		gap: 24px;
		isolation: isolate;
	}

	.video-container {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 480px;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		margin-top: 0;
		transform: translateY(-10px);
		transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
		background: transparent !important;
	}

	.video-container:hover {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: translateY(-12px);
	}

	.video-glow {
		position: absolute;
		top: 50%;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 1;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.media-placeholder {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		border: 1px dashed rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
		border-radius: 20px;
		background: #fafafa;
		color: #bbb;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.hero-placeholder {
		aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
		max-height: 520px;
	}

	.app-intro {
		z-index: 2;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 3.5rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: -0.05em;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
		color: #111;
	}

	.description {
		max-width: 580px;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: #555;
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin-bottom: 30px;
	}

	.app-store-link {
		display: inline-block;
		transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
	}

	.app-store-link:hover { transform: scale(1.04) translateY(-4px); }

	.badge-svg {
		height: 52px;
		width: auto;
		display: block;
		filter: drop-shadow(0 12px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.08));
	}

	.divider {
		height: 1px;
		background: #ffffff;
		margin: 30px 0;
	}

	.details-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 60px;
		margin-bottom: 120px;
	}

	.detail-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.floating-container {
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 1.5 / 1;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		margin-bottom: 2px;
	}

	h3 {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		color: #111;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}

	.detail-card p {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: #555;
		line-height: 1.7;
		max-width: 260px;
		margin: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.details-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 40px;
		}
		h1 { font-size: 2.8rem; }
	}
</style>
